{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SzeChunYiu/ORION/pulls/1449","id":4369821231,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT5fCLM8AAAABBHYuLw","html_url":"https://github.com/SzeChunYiu/ORION/pull/1449","diff_url":"https://github.com/SzeChunYiu/ORION/pull/1449.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/SzeChunYiu/ORION/pull/1449.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SzeChunYiu/ORION/issues/1449","number":1449,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[R9][Q1-C] Bind production-resource map and current prior art","user":{"login":"SzeChunYiu","id":52784502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzg0NTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52784502?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu","html_url":"https://github.com/SzeChunYiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SzeChunYiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Q1-C scope\n\nIndependent, additive Q1-C lane stacked on PR #1428 at `1e18787841d99d76a3c7661505838d2eca8780db`.\n\nThis PR:\n\n- content-binds the manuscript, claim ledger, analytic proof, R6M definition, R6S checker/receipt, and QG-21 production-accounting inputs to exact Git blobs and SHA-256 values;\n- maps the `(4,2,2,1)` support objective to a **conditional logical** two-qubit-Clifford accounting under an explicit all-to-all parity-ladder/single-control template;\n- establishes exactly nine arbitrary-angle rotations for the frozen three-block family but refuses to infer T count, T depth, qubits, physical spacetime, or hardware performance;\n- preserves the adverse QG-21 result: primary `theta_FT` chemistry remained donor-exact on `90/90` rows, with only the S1 sensitivity improving `18/90` by two logical two-qubit Clifford gates;\n- records a 2026-08-26 lawful primary-source search/subtraction across 16 version-bound sources, including TARE v4, PCOAST, PHOENIX, Symphony v2, current block-encoding resource work, and fault-tolerant compiler benchmarks; and\n- adds a fail-closed checker and mutation tests.\n\n## Terminals\n\n- source binding: `Q1_C_INPUTS_CONTENT_BOUND__PORTFOLIO_AUTHORITY_BINDING_STILL_REQUIRED`\n- production map: `PARTIAL_RESOURCE_MAP`\n- literature: `NOVELTY_NOT_ESTABLISHED`\n- journal authority: false\n\nThe bounded search did not locate a direct equivalent of the exact frozen `kappa_R6M=2` statement. This is not a novelty certificate. Q1-A/portfolio theorem selection, Q1-D independent review, architecture/routing, precision-bound rotation synthesis, error correction/factories, and measured compiler benchmarks remain open.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python papers/five-paper-top-tier-r8/Q1/check_q1_c_authority_r9.py`\n  - `ok=true`\n  - `resource_terminal=PARTIAL_RESOURCE_MAP`\n  - `literature_terminal=NOVELTY_NOT_ESTABLISHED`\n- `python -m pytest -q tests/unit/publication/test_q1_c_production_resource_literature_r9.py tests/unit/publication/test_q1_proof_sanity_binding.py`\n  - `7 passed`\n- Ruff on the checker and new tests: clean\n- `git diff --check`: clean\n\n## Authority boundary\n\nHashes, internal receipts, CI, same-lane literature search, and logical circuit identities do not grant external novelty, hardware, venue, or journal authority. `CANNOT_CHECK`, donor ties, adverse sensitivity outcomes, and the missing independent reviewer remain explicit.\n","created_at":"2026-08-26T18:41:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T18:41:15Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":nul